{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"A hero and her merry band of 6 adventurers once meet in the town of Trostenwald in the far off Dwendalian Empire. Fled they did from a false accusation. Entangled they were with a gentlemanly thief. Not long after one of their number fell. Long shall he reign. The terible Uk'otoa (he waits for people to quietly whisper the word Uk'otoa). Truely a a terrible creature that aimed to prevent the Hero from celebrating the most wonderful creature in all the worlds. Me. \nNeither Uk'otoa (waits) nor vokodo, nor Lucien and Cognuza would ever be able to stop them after I had give them the give of my company. As I now give to you. \nA shower of green and blue glitter rains down on the crowd.","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:43:15.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867960025354731540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
