{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Bonafide Bone","id":"467139287192829977","is_bot":0,"username":".bonafidebone"},"author_id":"467139287192829977","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Eldon steps forward pretending to look solomn he has his hands tied behind his back \"Tried and killed like thousands of other unnamed patriots, they sought to bring us down through execution, but as my head hung the people rose up\" his voice grows to gain some passion.\n\nA ball of fire (fire bolt) flies from Eldon hand at the stage followed by a release of smoke engulfing him (Bottle of Eversmoke), (Eldon sets up the next part in the smoke for a couple of seconds) at least 5 distinct voices can be heard singing along to the tune Eldon has kept playing behind him *\"Do you hear the people sing*\" (Cast disguise self)\n\nIs voice intensifies while covered in fog \"The hope of the people is more powerful then any airship, bombardment, or Staten Clanker\" now his voice ringing out in full deceleration\n\n\"and from those ashes the spirit of **Hope**, **Revolution**, and **Mercy** sought **To bring me back!**\"\" (Levitate) Eldon flies out from the smoke hovering just outside it in full Watcher armor\n\n\"Stronger then ever and with passion to serve my debt to those who did me this deepest favor, I am ready now\" he lands with a bow this time landing on one knee and bowing to the audience is voice his now low and more serious \"I have the honor to be your obedient servant\" he removes his helmet keeping his head bowed\n\nHe starts making away off stage after being judged","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:52:04.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867962241620799569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
