{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Eliza gets up there and a spot light hits her. \n\n\n\"I'll be blunt, I don't have any good stories to tell... BUT, I can tell you about my last mission and all the bloope... I mean professionals we are!\"\n\nShe then goes on to tell a stand up comedy act about all the wrongs that happened that were *mostly* true. After everyone being so heroic, it's a nice change and might shocks others. \n\n\"We were surrounded, about to be captured, could hear a pin drop in those few seconds\" she does a dramatic pause. \"And I hear someone just rips one all the way to the 13th state, and man if we didn't have moved, we might have died from!\" the crowd laughs \"I wonder if we filled a room with it if someone would actually die..\"\n\nshe goes on to tell the rest of the story, and keeps the heroic parts in, but with a funny twist.\n\n\"Oh yeah, large mini-guns are the coolest! They make the best fireworks!\"\n\nShe finishes it off and just bows to walk off. The entire thing professional, but still causal enough to loosen everyone up.","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:53:59.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867962722761982044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
